### cadastrar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "nome",
    "email": "email@email.com",
    "senha": "senha",
    "cpf": "12345678910",
    "endereco": "endereco",
    "telefone": "telefone"
}

### logar
# @name valToken
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email@email.com",
    "senha": "senha"
}

### ! ROTAS PRIVADAS

### consultar cliente id
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

### consultar cliente nome
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente?nome=nome
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

### listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

### atualizar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

{
    "telefone": "novo telefone"
}

### deletar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

### cadastrar drone
POST http://localhost:3000/drone
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "modelo",
    "marca": "marca",
    "numeroSerie": "1",
    "tipoServico": "tipoServico"
}

### consultar drone
GET http://localhost:3000/drone/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}